WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Guile places light Sonic Blade in front of crouching Dee Jay.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.150
Dee Jay guards the preceding Blade as Guile rushes in.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.850
Forward medium punch hits Dee Jay overhead.

4
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.150
Standing light punch links after the overhead.

5
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Perfect light Sonic Boom connects after the jab.

6
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.150
Crouching medium punch links between the first two Booms.

7
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.650
The second Perfect light Sonic Boom hits.

8
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.250
Back heavy punch links before the third Boom.

9
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:05.950
The third Perfect light Sonic Boom hits.

10
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.450
Standing heavy kick connects before the Super cancel.

11
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:08.650
Heavy Sonic Hurricane finishes the overhead conversion.

12
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:09.000
Dee Jay falls after the Super finish.
